# Everything the API image does not need: build output, test results, local exports and IDE state.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/crm-exports/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
.vs/
.idea/

# Environment-specific settings are git-ignored and never go into an image. The published appsettings.json holds
# placeholders only; every real value arrives through the environment at run time.
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.json
